      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Plymouth%2C_Connecticut",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "vague"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Atwater Monument on a hill overlooking Baldwin Park honors Civil War soldier Dorence Atwater, who recorded 13,000 deaths while a prisoner.",
